WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,080
He never actively attacked us from beginning to end

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,610
All we ask is that we stay out of personal grudges

3
00:00:04,610 --> 00:00:06,110
Why did Sun Tuo's mine machine fail?

4
00:00:06,110 --> 00:00:09,110
A high-level artist master rushed to the scene

5
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,270
He actively weakened the thunder and lightning

6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:13,270
And he's helping that zombie

7
00:00:13,270 --> 00:00:15,270
Can talk and control corpses

8
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:16,270
Possess a variety of artistic abilities

9
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:17,770
There is also assistance from human entertainers

10
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,770
Temporarily listed as No. 1 high-risk observation target

11
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:23,990
The task is not completed yet

12
00:00:23,990 --> 00:00:24,990
You saved the wrong person

13
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,490
I want to go back to find Ji Chuan

14
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:28,490
A high-risk target appeared at the scene

15
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,990
I can't let the team take another risk

16
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:31,990
What you promised was to find my friend

17
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:33,990
I heard his name

18
00:00:33,990 --> 00:00:34,990
he must be there

19
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:36,990
There is indeed a high-level performer at the scene.

20
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:38,990
But he's helping zombies

21
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:39,990
That could also be Ji Chuan's companion

22
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:41,990
Give me a car and I'll go by myself
